# Relative to cockpit-ui/.
# Finished files the running cockpit fetches are tracked. Negations below keep those paths visible.
# Bake leftovers stay ignored: trial pictures, glow checks, ground-truth captures, alternate scene exports, and module out/manifest.json files.
# Named module out pictures and grading-station/station_glow.png are not leftovers.
# Source files, regen scripts, and supplied help pictures stay unlisted.
